@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Create Booking A (requester)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs-with-booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "RESCHED-A-001",
  "model": "MODEL-A",
  "workcellId": 1,
  "vendorId": 1,
  "areaId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2025-12-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-12-01T09:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Create Booking B (receiver)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs-with-booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "RESCHED-B-001",
  "model": "MODEL-B",
  "workcellId": 2,
  "vendorId": 1,
  "areaId": 2,
  "startDateTime": "2025-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-12-01T11:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Create Swap Request with new receiver slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking-swap/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromBookingId": 1,
  "toBookingId": 2,
  "requestedByUserId": 10,
  "expiresInMinutes": 60,
  "receiverNewAreaId": 3,
  "receiverNewStart": "2025-12-01T12:00:00Z",
  "receiverNewEnd": "2025-12-01T13:00:00Z"
}

### 4. Approve GiveSlot_RescheduleReceiver
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking-swap/request/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "swapReqId": 1,
  "approverUserId": 99,
  "decisionType": "GiveSlot_RescheduleReceiver",
  "receiverNewAreaId": 3,
  "receiverNewStart": "2025-12-01T12:00:00Z",
  "receiverNewEnd": "2025-12-01T13:00:00Z"
}

### 5. Get Swap History for Booking A
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking-swap/history/booking/1

### 6. Get Swap History for Booking B
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking-swap/history/booking/2
